# Two things the walkthrough leaves out shape the route below. Air
# essence is scarce: the ending needs both an elevation and a wind
# at the mist, so the second wind at the mill's pits is skipped (the
# rune there shows without it). And the good ending needs all five
# of the party alive, so in Zan the rooms at the inn are taken before
# camping out; the inn burns, the party is jailed for it, and the
# gray reagent buys the way out with everyone.

